{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45962","headline":"题弘式和尚院兼呈杜使君 · 贯休","name":"题弘式和尚院兼呈杜使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二雅兼二密，愔愔祗自怡。\n腊高云屐朽，貌古画师疑。\n壍蚁缘金锡，罏烟惹雪眉。\n仍闻有新作，祗是寄相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}